#
#   gc - LibGC: cells, the heap, roots and weak references
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Part of the luce-browser port of Ladybird (47c82b38d0) to luce-base, DESIGN.md §4.1.
#       LibGC ported faithfully (DESIGN.md §3.2): heap blocks, cell allocators, precise marking
#       through visit_edges, conservative roots from the stack and registers, finalization,
#       weak cells and post-GC tasks. The additions of §3.2-§3.4 (managed blobs, atomic blobs,
#       the large-object space, the heap as luce-base's `Allocator`, the collector's own C-heap
#       containers, the stack and register scan in `asm`) are marked as such in their fragments.
